# Local-only fixtures; keep the source files out of Git.
# Expected model: avatar.vrm. Motions may use the legacy avatar.vrma or the
# motions/{idle,actions} library layout.
# Enable with AEGIS_AVATAR_DEBUG_ASSETS=1. Set
# AEGIS_AVATAR_DEBUG_DUMP=/tmp/aegis-avatar.png to save one preview frame.
# AEGIS_AVATAR_DEBUG_MOTION=greeting selects a named library motion.
# AEGIS_AVATAR_DEBUG_TIME=2.5 selects the sampled animation time in seconds.
# Use AEGIS_AVATAR_DEBUG_XDG=1 instead to preview the current XDG avatar.
*
!.gitignore
